# ==========================================================================
# Viranikosh Frontend — Environment Template
# --------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Copy to `.env` (or `.env.local`) if you need to override defaults.
# All Vite env vars must be prefixed with VITE_ to be exposed to the app.
# ==========================================================================

# Base URL for the backend API.
# - Leave unset in local dev: the app defaults to "/api", which the Vite dev
#   server proxies to the backend (see vite.config.ts).
# - In production/containers, point it at the backend, e.g.:
#     VITE_API_URL=https://api.your-domain.com/api
VITE_API_URL=/api
